188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 40 0 R
/T (The evidence shows an Active peering connection \(pcx-022336ab0aac38f2e\) between ewb-vpc-a \(10.10.0.0/16\) and ewb-vpc-b \(10.20.0.0/16\) in ap-southeast-2, with reciprocal routes in the route tables. Bidirectional ICMP succeeded with 0% packet loss \(Tests 01 and 02\), private instances were reached through a bastion using SSH ProxyJump \(Test 03\), and a 100% loss condition was observed in Test 04, demonstrating that connectivity depends on the supporting configuration. Test 05 \(recovery\) is not evidenced and should be supplied before final submission; security-group rules and the Test 04 fault-injection step are likewise not captured.)
/E (The evidence shows an Active peering connection \(pcx-022336ab0aac38f2e\) between ewb-vpc-a \(10.10.0.0/16\) and ewb-vpc-b \(10.20.0.0/16\) in ap-southeast-2, with reciprocal routes in the route tables. Bidirectional ICMP succeeded with 0% packet loss \(Tests 01 and 02\), private instances were reached through a bastion using SSH ProxyJump \(Test 03\), and a 100% loss condition was observed in Test 04, demonstrating that connectivity depends on the supporting configuration. Test 05 \(recovery\) is not evidenced and should be supplied before final submission; security-group rules and the Test 04 fault-injection step are likewise not captured.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
