316 0 obj
<<
/Title (Routing was configured per route table: the A-side tables send 10.20.0.0/16 to the peering connection, the B-side table sends 10.10.0.0/16 to it, and each retains its local route. The public route table additionally holds a default route to the internet gateway, so only the bastion is reachable from outside. Security groups must permit ICMP between the two CIDRs and SSH \(TCP 22\) from the bastion; because no security-group screenshot was supplied, no group IDs or rules are asserted here [MISSING EVIDENCE: security-group configuration]. Connectivity was verified from a Windows client using an SSH ProxyJump \(bastion as jump host\) to reach the private instances, then ICMP pings in both directions, followed by a controlled failure test.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 222 0 R
/Prev 315 0 R
/First 425 0 R
/Last 426 0 R
/Count -3
>>
endobj
